extends layout/AppLayout.pug
block contenido

  main.my-5
    .row
      .col-md-5
        img(src=`${viaje.imagen}` height="500" class="img-fluid")
      .col-md-7
        h1= viaje.titulo

        p.d-flex.align-items-center.text-muted.mb-1
          svg(xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='32' height='32' viewbox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#dc135f' stroke-width='1' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' class="mr-2")
            path(d='M4 5m0 2a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2h12a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v12a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2h-12a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2z')
            path(d='M16 3l0 4')
            path(d='M8 3l0 4')
            path(d='M4 11l16 0')
            path(d='M8 15h2v2h-2z')
          | #{viaje.fecha_ida} - #{viaje.fecha_vuelta}

        p.d-flex.align-items-center.text-muted.mb-1
          svg(xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='32' height='32' viewbox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#dc135f' stroke-width='1' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' class="mr-2")
            path(d='M12 12m-9 0a9 9 0 1 0 18 0a9 9 0 1 0 -18 0')
            path(d='M14.8 9a2 2 0 0 0 -1.8 -1h-2a2 2 0 1 0 0 4h2a2 2 0 1 1 0 4h-2a2 2 0 0 1 -1.8 -1')
            path(d='M12 7v10')
          | #{viaje.precio} Dolares

        p.d-flex.align-items-center.text-muted.mb-1
          svg(xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='32' height='32' viewbox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#dc135f' stroke-width='1' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' class="mr-2")
            path(d='M9 7m-4 0a4 4 0 1 0 8 0a4 4 0 1 0 -8 0')
            path(d='M3 21v-2a4 4 0 0 1 4 -4h4a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v2')
            path(d='M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75')
            path(d='M21 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0 -3 -3.85')
          | #{viaje.disponibles} Disponibles

        p.text-justify
          |  Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Nam ullamcorper lorem quis consequat lacinia. Phasellus enim tellus, cursus a tristique fermentum, interdum sed ipsum. Mauris est dui, sollicitudin et felis ut, lobortis efficitur neque. Donec pellentesque nulla nunc, at dictum nisl egestas eu. Suspendisse ut tellus nec sem lobortis posuere sed sit amet metus. Etiam dictum posuere est eget sollicitudin. In hac habitasse platea dictumst. Nunc ac maximus erat, vitae luctus ante. Donec pellentesque, lectus non viverra porta, lectus velit blandit mauris, sit amet efficitur erat nunc sit amet nisi. Vivamus faucibus lorem in elit vulputate egestas. Pellentesque non libero ipsum. Nunc ultrices libero id leo imperdiet, id consequat dolor pharetra. Cras aliquam posuere nibh id mattis. In hac habitasse platea dictumst. Praesent dapibus rhoncus justo, fermentum gravida urna mollis in. Fusce eget scelerisque ipsum.






